    <a class="press-item" id="patriarch" href="{{ site.donate }}"><img src="/images/seal-patriarchate.png" alt="" style="max-height:72px"><div><h3>Letter from His All-Holiness Ecumenical Patriarch Bartholomew</h3><p class="meta">The Phanar, Constantinople</p><p>"While your effort may be, as you describe it, grass roots, we are convinced that it is at the same time rooted in heaven." The Patriarch has received the Foundation's pilgrims in private audience and hosted three conferences in Constantinople.</p></div></a>
